OL,3,GNEWSATeen referees being 'reduced to
OL,4,Atears' by parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mum of a teenage referee has said
OL,7,Fyoung people are being bullied out of
OL,8,Fthe role by parents shouting abuse from
OL,9,Fthe sidelines.
OL,11,FBertie Glaister, 16, who lives near
OL,12,FCarlisle, said he often had to deal
OL,13,Fwith "aggressive adults" who disagreed
OL,14,Fwith decisions he made while refereeing
OL,15,Ffor the Cumberland FA.
OL,17,FHis mum Becky posted on Facebook about
OL,18,Fan incident at the weekend where she
OL,19,Fsaid a parent "accosted him", with
OL,20,Fthousands of people reacting to it.
OL,21,F"I've seen lads his age and older being
OL,22,Freduced to tears," she said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
