OL,3,GNEWSATeen referees being 'reduced to
OL,4,Atears' by parents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Cumberland FA, which supports
OL,7,Ffootball from grassroots to competitive
OL,8,Fplay across Cumbria, said there was
OL,9,Fcurrently a shortage of referees in the
OL,10,Fcounty.
